{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56424","headline":"还丹口诀 · 元阳子","name":"还丹口诀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"还丹篇，还丹篇，欲得黄芽先炬铅。\n阳壬不去火中走，阴丙如何得作烟。\n鸡抱卵兮日数足，母生子兮十月全。\n但得坤来爲屋宅，坤至何愁不作乾？\n伏吾此法在目前，违吾此法饶万年。\n八石须向火中走，莫弄水饱费君钱。\n还丹不是世难学，自是时人志不坚。\n若明魏君謌十首，千廻海水变桑田。\n（《大还丹照监》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元阳子","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56424.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56424","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}